    "Native constructor, allocator-live, clone-failure, destructor-order and raw delete traces remain unchanged. Existing Rust key/value Drop panic tests confirm cleanup and allocation release; native noexcept destructor behavior is not replaced by a fabricated throwing-C++ oracle.",
